        "tags": ["Wordpress", "PHP", "MySQL"],
        "coverImage": "../img/db-rm/db-rm-landing-page.png",
        "title": "DB-RM Solutions Corporate Website",
        "description": "I built the official website for DB-RM Solutions GbR, our Schönefeld-based company, to give us a professional yet approachable online presence. Using WordPress and a flexible theme builder, I focused on creating a clean, responsive layout that works perfectly on both desktop and mobile. I customized the design to feature a modern dark look as the default, ensuring the site feels current while staying easy for our clients to navigate. It was a great way to handle the full setup of a business site and build a solid foundation for our brand.",
